# Scratch of the body-model build: the 427 MB of source STL it fetches on
# demand, the lists it fetches them from, and every intermediate between
# the raw dump and the file that ships. Only the last of those is committed,
# as resources/models/body-zones.glb.
/scripts/body-model/stl/
/scripts/body-model/parts_list.txt
/scripts/body-model/stl_list.tsv
/scripts/body-model/selection.tsv
/scripts/body-model/*.glb

